    {
      "_id": "yvTHgSaty73PFVWg",
      "_key": "!journal.pages!OSMVQHNXfk9zRyLM.yvTHgSaty73PFVWg",
      "name": "Storyteller Notes",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>From here, Voight (@UUID[JournalEntry.yaAsxCkCLf8CANL5]{Dr. Anneliese Voight}) monitors Northline&#39;s communications. She knows the Puget Cell exists, but she doesn&#39;t know about ARCHER.</p>\n<p>Ruth (@UUID[JournalEntry.gRfqeOIXEHOcLemr]{Dr. Ruth Abernathy}) has a lab in the basement.</p>\n<p>If the coterie allies with Voight, they can get @UUID[JournalEntry.WW7eg88I0uDGj8ks]{FIRSTLIGHT, Internal Memo SEA-0411} here before @UUID[JournalEntry.C7cxKf7kcAELzuJ1.JournalEntryPage.EjJ0vfVBCjTTb0QV]{A3-E02 · The Data Center}.</p>\n"
      },
